{"step_index":1122,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T23:33:33Z","thinking":"**Identifying Existing Definitions and Lemmas**\n\nThe set union `{u} ∪ ...` is equivalent to `insert u (...)`, simplifying the expression. Examining `Challenge_e20263a9.lean`, two lemmas are already available: `mem_ballWithin_one_of_adj` and `mem_ballWithin_one_self`. These may be helpful when handling the disjunction `w = u ∨ G.Adj u w`.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"cat << 'EOF' > /mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9/test_weight2.lean\nimport Mathlib\nimport LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\n\nopen SimpleGraph\nopen GraphCalc\n\nlemma mem_ballWithin_of_walk {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] {v w : V} (p : G.Walk v w) :\n    w ∈ ballWithin G p.length v := by\n  induction p using SimpleGraph.Walk.concatRec with\n  | Hnil =>\n    dsimp [ballWithin]\n    exact Finset.mem_singleton_self _\n  | Hconcat p hadj ih =>\n    rw [SimpleGraph.Walk.length_concat]\n    dsimp [ballWithin]\n    rw [Finset.mem_union]\n    right\n    rw [Finset.mem_biUnion]\n    refine ⟨_, ih, ?_⟩\n    rw [Finset.mem_filter]\n    exact ⟨Finset.mem_univ _, hadj⟩\n\nlemma mem_ballWithin_one_of_adj {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (c u : V) (hadj : G.Adj c u) :\n    u ∈ ballWithin G 1 c :=\n  mem_ballWithin_of_walk G (SimpleGraph.Walk.cons hadj SimpleGraph.Walk.nil)\n\nlemma ballWithin_subset_succ {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (k : ℕ) (v : V) :\n    ballWithin G k v ⊆ ballWithin G (k + 1) v := by\n  intro x hx\n  dsimp [ballWithin]\n  exact Finset.mem_union_left _ hx\n\nlemma mem_ballWithin_one_self {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (c : V) :\n    c ∈ ballWithin G 1 c :=\n  ballWithin_subset_succ G 0 c (Finset.mem_singleton_self c)\n\nlemma ballWithin_one_eq_univ_of_adj_all {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (u : V)\n    (h : ∀ w : V, w = u ∨ G.Adj u w) :\n    ballWithin G 1 u = Finset.univ := by\n  ext w\n  simp only [Finset.mem_univ, iff_true]\n  cases h w with\n  | inl heq => rw [heq]; exact mem_ballWithin_one_self G u\n  | inr hadj => exact mem_ballWithin_one_of_adj G u w hadj\n\nEOF\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh test_weight2.lean\n","Cwd":"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9","WaitMsBeforeAsync":20000,"toolAction":"Testing ballWithin_one_eq_univ_of_adj_all with helper lemmas","toolSummary":"Check test_weight2.lean with helper lemmas"}}]}
