 hecc : GraphCalc.eccentricity G u ≤ 1 := by\n    unfold GraphCalc.eccentricity\n    exact minUpTo_le 1 h_card_ge h1\n  have hrad := radius_le_eccentricity G u\n  omega\n\nEOF\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh test_weight2.lean\n\nTask logs are available at: file:///tmp/agyhome.NWyWnj/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/f458c9cf-488d-4cd8-8365-7c4e4b16e3f9/.system_generated/tasks/task-1127.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
